  "summary_en": "Costa Rica's national AI strategy 2024-2027 (MICITT, March 2024). It sets six ethical guiding principles aligned with UNESCO and OECD, a governance model with an executive committee and territorial tables, a SWOT analysis, four strategic objectives and seven thematic axes. It has no robotics or physical-AI content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Six guiding principles: human dignity, equality, human oversight, transparency and access to information, confidentiality, intellectual property",
   "Creates an Executive Committee chaired by MICITT and regional territorial tables",
   "Creates the National AI Laboratory (LaNIA)",
   "Plans an ethical and regulatory framework by 2025 and a permanent AI regulatory sandbox by 2024",
   "Seven axes cover ethics, territorial nodes, infrastructure, smart government, skills, data security and privacy, and institutional climate"
